// formatNumber uses CUSTOM locale rules (not any real locale):
//   - Thousands separator: space ' ' (not comma)
//   - Decimal separator: comma ',' (not period)
//   - Grouping: groups of 2 from the right (not 3)
//     e.g., 1234567 => '1 23 45 67'
//   - Negative numbers: suffix 'n' instead of prefix '-'
